ps his arms up with one arm overhead.\n[Shot 2, 00:04.7–00:09.8] Cut to a frontal full-body shot. He rises, turns with his arms spread, lifts one knee while balancing with arms overhead, then lowers himself and rolls sideways once across the rooftop surface.\n[Shot 3, 00:09.8–00:15] Cut to a low wide shot from behind. He springs up, runs away across the rooftop toward the sunset skyline, makes a small running leap, lands softly and holds still.\n\nKeep his full body visible whenever the choreography requires it. Feet contact the ground with convincing weight, shadows move consistently on the rooftop, and the sunset rims his hair and jacket. Photorealistic footage with natural skin, real fabric, slight 35mm film grain, no CGI or plastic look. Natural real-time motion, no slow motion.\n\nSound: sneakers sliding and squeaking on concrete, denim jacket moving, gentle rooftop wind and distant city ambience. Music: upbeat indie pop with handclaps, lifting at the final leap. Clear, audible sound and music.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [360, 480], "pos": [-1480, 6430], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 9, "widgets_values_named": {"value": "<Picture 1> is the opening-frame and visual reference: the man in the denim jacket and white T-shirt on a rooftop parking deck at sunset. Begin with the framing and appearance of <Picture 1>. Keep his identity, short black hair, facial features, denim jacket, white printed T-shirt and dark trousers consistent throughout. Preserve the rooftop parking deck, concrete parapet, parking lines, distant city skyline and warm sunset light in every shot. Naturally reveal his full body as the camera pulls back. His l